@startuml
title Login
actor User
participant "Web app" as App
participant Server
database Database

== The user logs in ==
User -> App : types the password
App -> Server ++ : POST /login
Server -> Database : find the user
Database --> Server : the stored hash
alt the password is right
  Server -> Server : open a session
  Server --> App : 200 welcome
  App --> User : home page
else the password is wrong
  Server --> App : 401 refused
  App --> User : try again
end
note over User : the same for mobile
@enduml
